And yet, I end up hearing
that super-loud noise...

00:13:51.748 --> 00:13:54.876
Ah... Whoops, our bad.

00:13:55.084 --> 00:13:58.504
We're looking for a telepathist.
Would you help us out?

00:13:58.713 --> 00:14:03.217
Why now? You guys were never
interested in telepathy.

00:14:03.426 --> 00:14:05.011
No, we're really serious about this!

00:14:05.219 --> 00:14:08.097
You can tell if you hear
our thoughts, right?

00:14:08.306 --> 00:14:12.393
I don't want any more bad
experiences with telepathy.

00:14:12.602 --> 00:14:14.854
I don't plan on removing my earplugs.

00:14:15.063 --> 00:14:17.065
Ask someone else.

00:14:17.273 --> 00:14:19.942
You're looking for a kindred spirit, right?

00:14:20.151 --> 00:14:21.110
Huh?

00:14:21.319 --> 00:14:23.613
The reason you joined the club

00:14:23.821 --> 00:14:29.243
was because you thought you might
find someone else like you, right?

00:14:29.452 --> 00:14:31.037
Yeah, that's right.

00:14:31.245 --> 00:14:32.997
But it wasn't what I was looking for.

00:14:33.206 --> 00:14:35.541
It was just a club for people
obsessed with the occult.

00:14:35.541 --> 00:14:35.958
"Telepathy Club"” It was just a club
for people obsessed with the occult.

00:14:35.958 --> 00:14:36.167
"Telepathy Club"”

00:14:36.167 --> 00:14:37.085
"Telepathy Club"” And because of that, my hopes of
finding someone else like me basically faded away.

00:14:37.085 --> 00:14:37.293
And because of that, my hopes of finding
someone else like me basically faded away.

00:14:37.293 --> 00:14:39.504
"Body Improvement Club" And because of that, my hopes
of finding someone else like me basically faded away.

00:14:39.504 --> 00:14:42.715
And because of that, my hopes of finding
someone else like me basically faded away.

00:14:44.133 --> 00:14:48.346
I have no intention of letting you guys
use me for the sake of making memories.

00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:52.100
Use you? If you really think
that's how it's going to end up,

00:14:52.308 --> 00:14:54.685
you don't have to cooperate.

00:14:54.894 --> 00:14:57.605
If you have no interest at all, that is.

00:14:57.814 --> 00:15:00.441
What are you getting at?

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:04.570
I get sick of my own power, too,

00:15:04.779 --> 00:15:08.616
but it's a part of me
that I can't get rid of, even if I try.

00:15:08.825 --> 00:15:10.368
I think if there's someone
looking for that power,

00:15:10.576 --> 00:15:15.039
it might be fun to accept
them every once in a while.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.836
Who the hell do you think you are?
Like you know how I feel.

00:15:20.044 --> 00:15:21.796
This is how I feel, though.

00:15:28.761 --> 00:15:33.057
W-Well, I can't stand the thought of
you guys emitting that noise again,

00:15:33.266 --> 00:15:36.727
so I guess I'll help you out
just this once.

00:15:37.645 --> 00:15:39.814
Yeah! You're a lifesaver, Takenaka!

00:15:40.022 --> 00:15:41.607
Thank goodness!

00:15:43.901 --> 00:15:46.112
Takenaka-senpai.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:49.490
Did you read my brother's mind?

00:15:49.699 --> 00:15:51.075
You're his little brother, huh?

00:15:51.284 --> 00:15:53.119
Who knows?

00:15:53.327 --> 00:15:56.539
You have some complex about not being
on the same wavelength as your brother?

00:15:56.747 --> 00:15:59.542
Is that what I'm saying in my mind?!

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.544
I just randomly said it.

00:16:01.752 --> 00:16:05.673
Even with these earplugs in, I get the gist
just by looking at someone's eyes.

00:16:05.882 --> 00:16:09.510
I want to keep things like that special.

00:16:10.761 --> 00:16:11.262
So, what do you want me to do?

00:16:11.262 --> 00:16:13.806
"Telepathy Club"” "...Improvement
Club" So, what do you want me to do?

00:16:13.806 --> 00:16:14.557
"Telepathy Club"”
"...Improvement Club"

00:16:14.765 --> 00:16:16.225
"Hideaway Café"
"Spirits and Such Consultation Office"

00:16:16.225 --> 00:16:16.517
"Hideaway Café" "Spirits and Such
Consultation Office" Here you go.

00:16:16.517 --> 00:16:17.143
"Spirits and Such Consultation Office"
Here you go.

00:16:17.143 --> 00:16:17.226
"Spirits and Such Consultation Office"

00:16:17.351 --> 00:16:20.980
This is some purified kelp tea we just
started doing online orders for.

00:16:21.189 --> 00:16:24.233
It gets pretty dry in the winter because
of that spiritual... you know.

00:16:24.442 --> 00:16:26.444
Please make sure to stay hydrated.

00:16:26.652 --> 00:16:29.906
If you don't have enough water in
your body, your circulation gets bad,

00:16:30.114 --> 00:16:33.534
and an evil spirit that causes
fatigue and grogginess,

00:16:33.743 --> 00:16:35.495
like you're feeling right now, shows up.

00:16:35.703 --> 00:16:37.663
Huh...

00:16:37.872 --> 00:16:39.415
Thank you very much!

00:16:39.624 --> 00:16:42.668
I'll be looking forward to our
next appointment, Reigen-sensei

00:16:45.087 --> 00:16:48.591
Whew... My body's feeling
pretty heavy, too.

00:16:48.799 --> 00:16:52.053
I seriously don't feel like doing
anything when it gets this cold.

00:16:52.053 --> 00:16:52.261
"Reception” I seriously don't feel like
doing anything when it gets this cold.

00:16:52.261 --> 00:16:52.470
"Reception”

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.638
"Reception”
What are you doing?

00:16:53.638 --> 00:16:53.763
"Reception”

00:16:53.846 --> 00:16:57.642
My homework. I need to finish
during winter break.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.101
Winter break, eh?

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.896
Man, must be nice to have things
to look forward to as a student.

00:17:02.104 --> 00:17:05.274
Hey, wanna go for some drinks?

00:17:05.483 --> 00:17:10.488
I'm sorry. My friends from school and I
are having a year-end party today.

00:17:10.696 --> 00:17:12.073
I see...

00:17:14.325 --> 00:17:17.036
Hey, Mob. What's up?

00:17:17.245 --> 00:17:20.665
New Year's Eve plans?
I've got nothing booked yet.

00:17:20.873 --> 00:17:23.042
You going on a first shrine
visit or something?

00:17:23.251 --> 00:17:28.381
What? Mt. Mud Boat? UFOs?

00:17:28.589 --> 00:17:32.552
Okay, fine. Jeez.

00:17:35.263 --> 00:17:38.057
I guess I'm gonna see the year
out looking for UFOs.

00:17:38.266 --> 00:17:43.521
Those little brats really just called me
to get a rental car for them.

00:17:43.729 --> 00:17:47.817
Damn it. Why am I gonna be
babysitting on New Year's Eve?

00:17:47.817 --> 00:17:48.067
"Huge Year-End Exorcism Blowout Sale" "For a limited time ring in the New Year with a smile with our bargain courses. Leave it to Reigen
Arataka!! Our bargain year-end plans come with a coupon for the New Year." Damn it. Why am I gonna be babysitting on New Year's Eve?

00:17:48.067 --> 00:17:48.276
"Huge Year-End Exorcism Blowout Sale" "For a limited time ring in the New Year with a smile with our bargain
courses. Leave it to Reigen Arataka!! Our bargain year-end plans come with a coupon for the New Year."

00:17:48.276 --> 00:17:51.279
"Huge Year-End Exorcism Blowout Sale" "For a limited time ring in the New Year with a smile with our bargain courses. Leave
it to Reigen Arataka!! Our bargain year-end plans come with a coupon for the New Year." I'm happy for you, Reigen-san.

00:17:51.279 --> 00:17:51.404
I'm happy for you, Reigen-san.

00:17:51.612 --> 00:17:53.781
Huh? Mt. Mud Boat?

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:55.783
No, I'm not going.

00:17:55.992 --> 00:17:57.910
I've got a cram school camp
during winter break.

00:17:58.119 --> 00:18:02.832
The Telepathy Club is done now,
so if you want to go, do it on your own.

00:18:05.167 --> 00:18:06.377
She said she won't go.

00:18:06.586 --> 00:18:09.255
Seriously, President Kurata?

00:18:09.463 --> 00:18:12.717
I guess we're just gonna have to keep
bugging her until New Year's Eve.

00:18:12.925 --> 00:18:15.052
I'm sure she'll say yes.

00:18:15.261 --> 00:18:21.142
However, President Kurata stopped
answering her phone after that.

00:18:23.311 --> 00:18:23.603


00:18:23.603 --> 00:18:26.188
And then, New Year's Eve arrived.

00:18:26.188 --> 00:18:26.272


00:18:28.816 --> 00:18:30.943
Man, I slept great.

00:18:31.152 --> 00:18:33.195
I woke up naturally.

00:18:35.239 --> 00:18:36.240
Huh?

00:18:36.449 --> 00:18:39.660
It's out of batteries!
You've gotta be shitting me!

00:18:39.869 --> 00:18:43.372
I always tell Mob how important
it is to be punctual!

00:18:45.082 --> 00:18:48.002
Huh? Tome-san can't come?

00:18:48.919 --> 00:18:51.172
We haven't been able to get a hold of her.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:54.759
But she'll be really happy if we
can show her a picture of a UFO.

00:18:54.967 --> 00:18:56.260
Yeah.

00:18:56.469 --> 00:18:59.597
Then we should actually find one.

00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:05.478
She's right there...

00:19:05.686 --> 00:19:07.772
Earlier than any of us...

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:10.107
What are you doing here,
President Kurata?

00:19:10.316 --> 00:19:11.776
What about your camp?

00:19:11.984 --> 00:19:14.445
I totally bailed on it.

00:19:14.654 --> 00:19:17.031
What? I'm not allowed to go now?

00:19:17.239 --> 00:19:20.660
No... Just, why didn't you
answer your phone?

00:19:20.868 --> 00:19:24.205
Oh? My phone was broken
and I didn't notice.

00:19:24.413 --> 00:19:26.207
What the hell?

00:19:26.415 --> 00:19:29.960
So? Where's this telepathist that
you boys supposedly found?

00:19:30.169 --> 00:19:31.837
Oh, does she not know yet?

00:19:32.046 --> 00:19:34.548
Yeah, I figured she wouldn't
come if we told her.

00:19:34.757 --> 00:19:37.134
We were supposed to meet at 9 AM, right?

00:19:37.343 --> 00:19:39.387
Let's wait a little longer.

00:19:41.806 --> 00:19:45.559
Er, they're not coming, are they?

00:19:45.768 --> 00:19:48.270
Why the hell isn't he answering?

00:19:50.398 --> 00:19:53.484
Is it really okay to make
your mentor wait this long?

00:19:53.693 --> 00:19:55.528
Hm... I'm not sure.

00:19:55.736 --> 00:19:59.240
I sent him a message about our situation,
but he hasn't replied.

00:19:59.448 --> 00:20:02.118
We might have to cancel this whole thing.

00:20:03.452 --> 00:20:05.579
You're late, Takenaka!

00:20:06.789 --> 00:20:08.749
Sorry, my bad. I overslept.

00:20:08.958 --> 00:20:12.753
Takenaka? What are you doing here?

00:20:12.962 --> 00:20:15.715
Sorry I'm late...

00:20:15.923 --> 00:20:20.678
President Kurata, I'm a telepathist.

00:20:20.886 --> 00:20:21.887
Huh?

00:20:22.096 --> 00:20:25.683
What? Are you messing with me?

00:20:25.891 --> 00:20:30.438
Well, anyway. We're all here now,
so let's head to the parking lot.

00:20:30.646 --> 00:20:31.564
Run!

00:20:31.772 --> 00:20:35.985
Hurry, hurry! He might've
gotten mad and gone home already.

00:20:36.193 --> 00:20:37.778
He's there!

00:20:38.696 --> 00:20:41.490
I'm sorry that we're late, Master!

00:20:41.699 --> 00:20:44.034
Oh, hey. Don't even worry about it.

00:20:44.243 --> 00:20:48.122
It's New Year's Eve today,
so let's take our time.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:50.791
He arrived just two minutes before.

00:20:53.419 --> 00:20:56.422
O-O-Okay, let's get going.

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:59.091
Please make sure to drive safely.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:03.179
Don't... talk to me for a while.

00:21:07.391 --> 00:21:10.478
Why did you oversleep
on such an important day?

00:21:11.395 --> 00:21:13.355
I had a hard time falling asleep.

00:21:13.564 --> 00:21:16.108
Were you hearing too many voices again?

00:21:16.317 --> 00:21:18.068
No, I was just nervous.

00:21:18.277 --> 00:21:20.404
It's been a while since
I've done anything like this.

00:21:20.613 --> 00:21:22.573
I see.

00:21:22.782 --> 00:21:24.575
Want some gum, Prez?

00:21:24.784 --> 00:21:26.577
Hmph. No.

00:21:26.786 --> 00:21:31.248
How dare you trick me, trying to tell me
that Takenaka's a telepathist.

00:21:31.457 --> 00:21:32.750
No, really. He's the real deal.

00:21:32.958 --> 00:21:33.876
It's fine.

00:21:34.084 --> 00:21:37.963
In the end, I'm not even sure
if I can call over a UFO, so...

00:21:40.466 --> 00:21:43.010
You are approaching your destination.

00:21:43.219 --> 00:21:45.179
Hey, is this it?

00:21:45.387 --> 00:21:49.642
Mt. Mud Boat...
It's gonna be pretty rocky ahead.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:53.729
You guys better not get carsick
before we look for UFOs.

00:21:55.231 --> 00:21:57.441
There was a blue light shining

00:21:57.650 --> 00:21:59.902
I'm wide awake this 1:30 AM

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.530
What remained even after I swiped

00:22:02.738 --> 00:22:06.367
Are the smiles of my friends right beside me

00:22:15.376 --> 00:22:17.586
Yes, I want someone to understand...

00:22:17.795 --> 00:22:20.130
This wish that's hidden colorless and invisible

00:22:20.339 --> 00:22:22.675
The breath I was holding deep within my heart

00:22:22.883 --> 00:22:25.344
I let it all out at once and return to my senses

00:22:25.553 --> 00:22:27.721
On days that I'm feeling apathetic
it suddenly comes to mind

00:22:27.930 --> 00:22:30.266
These seasons I spent as if they were a given

00:22:30.474 --> 00:22:32.768
Even if reality becomes sullied

00:22:32.977 --> 00:22:36.021
Only the sky we saw together is real

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:38.148
This is more incomprehensible

00:22:38.357 --> 00:22:40.401
Than the grammar on the blackboard

00:22:40.609 --> 00:22:42.820
If it's going to disappear within 24 hours

00:22:43.028 --> 00:22:45.698
This flowing story is just too lonely

00:22:45.906 --> 00:22:47.616
I just can't do it

00:22:47.825 --> 00:22:49.827
Just like that back hip circle I gave up on

00:22:50.035 --> 00:22:52.329
But I'm not going to...

00:22:52.538 --> 00:22:53.873
Give up

00:22:54.081 --> 00:22:55.666
My present anymore

00:22:55.875 --> 00:22:58.085
I adorn my overflowing emotions

00:22:58.294 --> 00:23:00.629
And run through my worries and hesitations

00:23:00.838 --> 00:23:03.132
It can't be decided from 0 to 100

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:05.676
Draw the incomplete future with this hand

00:23:05.885 --> 00:23:08.137
We can't even prove its existence

00:23:08.345 --> 00:23:11.307
But as the world stabs the middle of my chest

00:23:11.515 --> 00:23:14.643
It overflows with cobalt blue

00:23:23.193 --> 00:23:24.945
